 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "A monster is {\"name\", \"health\", \"attack\"}. Turns alternate, team A first: the first surviving monster of the acting team attacks the first surviving monster of the other team for damage = attack. Each attack appends \"<attacker> attacks <defender> for <damage> damage, <defender> has <h> health left\" where h is the remaining health clamped at 0; a defender whose health drops to 0 or below appends \"<defender> is defeated\" and the next monster of its team comes forward. When a team has no monster left, append \"Team A wins\" or \"Team B wins\" and stop.",
  "provenance": [
